<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 117 0 R
/E (AI4Startups is a programme focused on strengthening the African tech ecosystem by fostering AI development, responsible data governance, data sharing and innovation with a particular emphasis on the agricultural sector. The initiative is implemented by Digital Africa, in collaboration with Expertise France, as part of the broader Data Governance in Africa Initiative.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
