<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 118 0 R
/E (This study employed a two-phase mixed-methods design, combining a quantitative survey with qualitative in-depth interviews. The two phases were designed to be complementary: the survey captured the scale and distribution of regulatory and data governance challenges across a broad cohort, while the interviews provided the narrative depth and contextual specificity needed to understand why and how those challenges manifest in practice.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
