/P 118 0 R
/E (A structured online survey of 20 questions was distributed to African startups operating in the eight priority countries and across four priority sectors. The survey was distributed via the Youform and Typeform platforms and used conditional branching logic to ensure respondents only answered questions relevant to their profile.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [11]
>>
