/P 125 0 R
/E (These barriers cluster into three recurring themes: quality and availability failures \(data exists but is too poor or scarce to be usable\); legal and permission barriers \(unclear licensing, data ownership ambiguity, and restricted government access\); and infrastructure and cost barriers \(expensive procurement, technical incompatibility, and the cost of sourcing quality agricultural and environmental data\).)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [7]
>>
