344 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 129 0 R
/E (A striking finding from this cohort is the degree to which data protection laws are perceived as enabling rather than limiting. 72% of respondents said that data protection and sharing laws primarily help their work. Only 10% said laws primarily limit operations.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
