358 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 130 0 R
/E (The high ranking of data governance and internal policies above the often-cited data localisation and cross-border transfer rules suggests that the most immediate compliance burden for these startups is not international regulatory harmonisation but the ability to establish functional internal data governance systems. Many are sharing data and using AI without the internal policies and documentation frameworks needed to do so responsibly.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [7]
>>
