/P 136 0 R
/T (Build sector-specific data access guides for all four priority sectors)
/E (Build sector-specific data access guides for all four priority sectors)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
482 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 136 0 R
/E (Plain-language guides explaining what government data exists in each priority country, how to formally request it, what licensing applies, what fees \(if any\) are involved, and what to do when access is denied would immediately reduce the time and cost startups spend navigating government data bureaucracies. These guides should be updated annually, include sample request letters and follow-up templates, and flag known access pathways that have worked for other startups. The guides should cover AgriTech data needs \(soil, crop yield, weather, land records\), Food Tech needs \(nutrition statistics, food safety certification, traceability standards\), Energy Tech needs \(grid load, outage histories, meter data\), and Climate Tech needs \(emissions data, carbon registry access, meteorological records\).)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
