/P 137 0 R
/T (Advocate for AI inference credits and affordable compute access for African startups)
/E (Advocate for AI inference credits and affordable compute access for African startups)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
485 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 137 0 R
/E (The cost of AI tools, cloud services, and hardware is the single largest barrier to AI adoption in this cohort. Group rate agreements with major cloud providers \(AWS, Google Cloud, Microsoft Azure\), modelled on existing academic research credit programmes, should be negotiated at the programme level and made available to all AI4Startups cohort members. )
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
