/E (Commission a follow-up validation workshop to test draft templates)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
488 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 137 0 R
/E (Per the Lot 1 methodology, a virtual or hybrid validation workshop presenting these findings and initial draft templates to representative startups from across the eight priority countries would ensure the tools developed under Lot 2 are grounded in actual startup needs. The workshop should include structured feedback sessions on each of the five recommended template types, with particular attention to the clauses that startups find most difficult to negotiate in practice. Findings from the workshop should be incorporated into the final template versions before publication.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
