/Title (The single most demanded support is better data-sharing platforms, followed by clearer laws and AI capacity building. Better data-sharing platforms \(42%\), clearer laws and regulations \(39%\), and technical training and AI capacity building \(39%\) are the top three support needs. Simplified legal templates and access to quality training data also feature prominently.)
