/Title (The most actionable gap identified by this study is the mismatch between the data-sharing activity that is already occurring and the governance infrastructure supporting it. Most startups are sharing data but without adequate legal frameworks, technical standards, or trust mechanisms. Addressing this gap through practical legal templates, regional data standards, and targeted capacity building is the clearest immediate priority for the AI4Startups platform.)
